@TaskManager_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095

### Listar todas as tarefas
GET {{TaskManager_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar tarefa por id
GET {{TaskManager_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar tarefa inexistente (esperado 404)
GET {{TaskManager_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas/999
Accept: application/json

###

### Criar nova tarefa
POST {{TaskManager_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Estudar .NET",
  "concluida": false
}

###

### Atualizar tarefa existente
PUT {{TaskManager_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Estudar ASP.NET Core",
  "concluida": true
}

###

### Atualizar tarefa inexistente (esperado 404)
PUT {{TaskManager_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Nao existe",
  "concluida": false
}

###

### Excluir tarefa
DELETE {{TaskManager_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas/1

###

### Excluir tarefa inexistente (esperado 404)
DELETE {{TaskManager_HostAddress}}/api/tarefas/999
